"with complete inverse Hessian. May converge faster for small systems   "
"but uses more memory (O(n²) per image).  **Global optimizers** (treat all"
" images together):  - **FIRE**: No Hessian, handles oscillations well. "
"Good fallback.  - **LBFGS/BFGS**: Global optimizer for all images "
"combined (~1365 DOF).   Can oscillate due to mixing curvature from "
