#: 7213b2ef63434bf59677a2ef35b2b36c
#: atomate2.siesta.flows.neb.ase_neb.PerImageLBFGS:7 of
msgid ""
"**Small Hessian per image**: Each image has ~195 DOF (65 atoms × 3), not "
"~1365 DOF (7 images × 65 atoms × 3). Smaller Hessians are easier to "
"approximate accurately."
msgstr ""

#: atomate2.siesta.flows.neb.ase_neb.PerImageLBFGS:11
#: e75828b23e9f436bafe5b9e492cf3e90 of
msgid ""
"**Local curvature learning**: Each image learns its own local potential "
"energy surface curvature, rather than trying to mix curvature information"
" from different images."
msgstr ""

#: atomate2.siesta.flows.neb.ase_neb.PerImageLBFGS:15
#: da55547a2efc4ae4bc7306c2a5713db4 of
msgid ""
"**Better handling of NEB forces**: NEB forces are projected "
"(perpendicular DFT + parallel spring), which confuses global optimizers "
"but works well with per-image optimization."
msgstr ""

